  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICVA is an umbrella organisation, co-ordinating NGOs (local and international) in FR Yugoslavia. They have applied for support in order to continue this work and e g offer training to local NGOs. They also offer certain facilities to NGOs and act as an interface between NGOs and different international organisations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICVA &#xE4;r en paraplyorganisation som koordinerar NGOs (lokala och internationella) i FR Jugoslavien. De s&#xF6;ker st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r att forts&#xE4;tta med detta arbete och erbjuda utbildning &#xE5;t lokala NGOs. De erbjuder &#xE4;ven olika faciliteter &#xE5;t NGOs och agerar som ett interface mellan NGOs och div. internationella organisationer.</narrative>
  </description>
